        <mxCell id="Mrkxx1X9o3tyWwIIMo9J-62" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Implementación de Suites de Expectativas,&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Aquí definimos &quot;el contrato&quot; de los datos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Perfiles (Profiling),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Antes de poner reglas, el sistema analiza el dato para entender qué es &quot;normal&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Falla de DAGs),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Si los datos no pasan las pruebas de calidad:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1270" y="2429" width="270" height="132" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Mrkxx1X9o3tyWwIIMo9J-66" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Amazon CloudWatch .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Cada vez que una &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Lambda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; procesa un sensor o un &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;73&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Glue Job&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; limpia una tabla, deja un rastro (Logs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Roles Mínimos ,&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;IAM (Identity and Access Management)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Asignamos los permisos justos y necesarios para que, si una pieza es hackeada, el resto del sistema esté a salvo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strike&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot;&gt;CloudWatch:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Logs, métricas y alarmas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,1,0&quot;&gt;IAM:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Roles y permisos (quién entra y quién no).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,2,0&quot;&gt;CloudTrail:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; El rastro de auditoría (quién cambió qué).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25,3,0&quot;&gt;AWS Trusted Advisor:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Te da consejos sobre cómo mejorar la seguridad y el costo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/strike&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
